  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "MLA",
      "items": [
        "K and V live in a 192-dim latent space; the positional key adds 24 values per token per layer",
        "Manual absorption projects q_nope with wkv_b_k in the eager path; the SDPA path materializes K/V instead (models/mla.py:MultiHeadLatentAttention.forward)",
        "216 vs 1536 floats/token/layer is arithmetic against a dense baseline, not a measured cache benchmark"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "DeepSeekMoE",
      "items": [
        "Expert share is computed from the configured parameter layout, not a runtime profile",
        "Top-4 of 20 routed experts run per token (configured)",
        "Aux-loss-free: a bias buffer steers routing; no gradient touches it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "MTP",
      "items": [
        "Predicts token t+2 through the shared embedding and head",
        "Adds ~7.08M params (project parameter log); totals are counts, not measured memory",
        "Single-step speculative decoding exists, but its verification conditioning needs a separate correctness review"
      ]
    }
